    docs: remove dead index generator and document metrics. Addresses CLN-002 and DOC-10.
    
    CLN-002: remove generate_index.py.handwritten after a recursive search of
    Python, Markdown and shell files found no references. The canonical
    python3 scripts/generate_index.py --generate exits 0 and its regenerated
    index contains zero .tmp/ spec paths; restore _index.json after probing.
    
    DOC-10: document unauthenticated GET /metrics in both API HTTP transport
    inventories with the exact exposition Content-Type and a reference to
    docs/observability-spec.md section 9.1. Add /metrics and /events to the
    getting-started route table and keep the auth summary consistent.
    
    Verification: npm ci --no-audit --no-fund; npm run build; full Vitest run
    with worktree-local TMPDIR: 122 files passed, 4 skipped; 2022 tests passed,
    58 skipped. API metrics mention count 2; getting-started count 1.
    Vitest regenerates _index.json, so restore it again after the suite.
    Use git restore --source=HEAD --worktree for the requested index restore
    rather than git checkout; both restore the committed bytes.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
